OL,3,ANorway's King Harald dies aged 89
OL,4,
OL,5,FNorway's King Harald V has died at the
OL,6,Fage of 89, after he was taken to
OL,7,Fhospital last week for treatment for a
OL,8,Frare blood condition.
OL,10,FThe palace in Oslo said he passed away
OL,11,Fpeacefully at 06:35 local time
OL,12,F(04:35GMT) on Friday at the national
OL,13,Fhospital in Oslo.
OL,15,FIn the 24 hours leading up to his
OL,16,Fdeath, members of the royal family had
OL,17,Fvisited the king, and crowds had laid
OL,18,Fflowers at the palace.
OL,20,FHarald was Norway's first king born in
OL,21,FNorway since the 14th Century. He will
OL,22,Fbe succeeded by his son Haakon.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
